        "TileImage": "$($repository e9a9bc5a-6558-4baa-9fd9-affc452b6c2a).Image",
        "Description": "A high-stakes contract has reached us amidst the streets of Mumbai. The city&apos;s skyline hangs in peril as a shadowy syndicate threatens the Rangan Tower&apos;s construction, infiltrate, and embrace the fireman tool of the fire axe, to discreetly eliminate three members behind this sabotage.\rThe fate of the tower and the unraveling of a criminal empire rest on your skills.\r       \r       \rAvoid detection and leave no trace, lest the trail to their masterminds are bound to go cold.",
